fysetc-5inch-dsi (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package display overlay, DKMS panel driver and touch poller as one .deb.
  * Touch poller: discard invalid controller frames (device mode, TD_STATUS,
    duplicate IDs, out-of-range coordinates), debounce new contacts, emit only
    changed values, release contacts on persistent read errors or garbage,
    set axis resolution, refuse to run when a kernel driver owns 0x38, and
    add a probe mode (-p) for raw register dumps.
  * Panel driver build: build against the kernel DKMS targets instead of
    the running kernel.

 -- niklas389 <niklas389@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
